<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia May palm oil exports 641,950t-Caleb Brett.</title>
<headline>Malaysia May palm oil exports 641,950t-Caleb Brett.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's May bulk palm oil exports at 641,950 tonnes against its estimate of 631,334 for April, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put official April exports at 570,067 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-275-6834)</p>
